WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.540
- We have a video of you working
on Firefly Lane from home.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.500
So, let's see the video.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.740
- [Director] Are you ready?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.290
- [Kathrine] Mm-hmm.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.290
- [Director] Action.

00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:12.735
- Oh, yes. Yes.

00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:17.350
(audience laughs)

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.910
- I mean, take that one Harry Met Sally

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.833
or Seven from Friends.

00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:28.592
So, the kids are used to shouting

00:00:28.592 --> 00:00:32.442
coming from the other room
now, so you're in the clear.

00:00:32.442 --> 00:00:33.275
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:33.275 --> 00:00:35.810
- You gotta wonder what
they were thinking?

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.220
- Yeah, you can just now
always say you were working.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.044
Oh, we were working on a project.

00:00:40.044 --> 00:00:40.877
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:41.710
- Yeah, no.

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:43.160
My Adalaide said to me
the other day that she

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.830
and Naleigh give each other a look

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.290
when they hear something weird.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.681
And I said, "What do you mean by weird?

00:00:47.681 --> 00:00:49.020
What do you hear that's weird?"

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.780
And she was like, "well, you know,

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:54.180
if we hear shouting or you
and dad laughing really hard

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.013
or, you know..."

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:55.943
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:55.943 --> 00:00:57.740
"There's always something
about you grabbing Dad's butt."

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:58.960
And I was like, "Okay."

00:00:58.960 --> 00:00:59.793
- [Kelly] Okay. (laughs)

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:02.371
- Maybe we should be more
quiet about these things.

00:01:02.371 --> 00:01:03.440
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.590
Or show them how a fun
relationship sounds.

